Macintosh Skeletal Filled / Macintosh Skeletal Variable

The fonts in this repository are derived from "Macintosh Skeletal"
(MacintoshSkeletal.otf), a font distributed by Apple Inc. with macOS 27 and
iOS 27, and from the output of Apple's hello-screen renderer.

Macintosh Skeletal, its letterforms, its stroke data, and the design of the
"hello" handwriting are the property of Apple Inc. Copyright (c) Apple Inc.
All rights reserved. "Apple", "Macintosh", "Mac", "iPhone", "macOS" and "iOS"
are trademarks of Apple Inc.

